   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Gallery saturation: median ~86, the most saturated look of the set (0.49), magenta-tinted shadows (44,35,40), sky (88,126,168) sat 0.48, foliage sat 0.56, magenta accents. Best for: Hero wall-print frames: canyons, red rock, aurora, sunsets, lavender, autumn, waterfalls. Very strong - use at 50-70% Amount on ordinary frames; full strength only on the one hero image.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
